1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,999
[Music] Praise be to Jesus Christ.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,999
A thousand thanks to Mother and the Holy Son for blessing me to stand in this holy sanctuary.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,999
My name is Rose Benny, I am a member of St. Mary’s Basilica Parish, Champakulam.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,999
Our way of life is farming.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,999
Now we are doing about nine acres, most of it owned and some leased. Last December 2024, due to a sudden depression—

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,999
everyone knows about the floods in Chennai and also the continuous rains here for about a week—

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,999
in our entire nine acres, not a single stalk of paddy was standing; everything had fallen flat to the ground. Everyone started mocking us.

8
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,999
They all said nothing at all could be harvested from it. But I had no tension, no worry at all.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,999
Because I had entrusted everything to Mother. While sowing the paddy itself, I used to recite the Creed and sprinkle salt in faith in every corner.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,999
We would walk around the field reciting the Creed and the rosary prayers.

11
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,999
Then everyone asked me, “In this field, except for Bennychettan’s paddy, everyone else’s hasn't fallen like this—

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,999
but in Bennychettan’s, not even a single stalk is standing straight. What will you do now?”

13
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,999
They mocked us, but I said, no problem — I have entrusted it to the One I should.

14
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,999
To those who know the Word, I would say, what is impossible for man is possible for God.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,999
I fully believed. We used to go to church every day. Benny at first was tense, worrying, “What will we do, what will we do, so much debt, what will we do?”

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,999
I told him, don’t sit at home in tension. Come with me to church. Go every day to the church and surrender at the altar, we can do nothing else.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,999
December 12th was the date they told us the machine would come.

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,999
That day the heavy rains still hadn’t stopped. The machines came and went back.

19
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:02,999
We have a custom of always giving money for Holy Mass whenever we do anything. Then I said, this time we haven’t given for Holy Mass. Let us first offer for the Mass.

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,999
On the way to Mass, we met Father and gave him the offering.

21
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:15,999
I always told Mother, “Along with the tension and people’s mockery, Benny is also feeling unwell. Mother, please show us a sign.” I always prayed like that.

22
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:29,999
That day after Mass, in the evening, as I was going for the rosary, while reciting, I told Mother, “Mother, I am sure. Mother, help us. Benny needs a certainty. Mother, you must show a sign.”

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,999
After finishing the rosary, when I looked up, I saw a rainbow in the sky.

24
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,999
At first I thought, is it just my imagination? Then I looked again and again.

25
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,999
No, I was sure — it was a rainbow. I immediately called Benny and everyone at home: “Come quickly, Mother is showing us a sign!”

26
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,999
Everyone came and saw. We glorified Mother greatly. We felt an indescribable peace and joy.

27
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,999
Because the field was thought to be unharvestable. Rain was forecast again, so harvesting was abandoned, machines were leaving.

28
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:05,999
At that very time, Mother gave us a sign. We became sure. I prayed not only for myself but for our whole field, for everyone.

29
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:12,999
Because it was a time when everyone was in sorrow and distress. At that time, no one went to the fields anymore.

30
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,999
Everyone had abandoned them, saying they couldn’t be harvested.

31
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:27,999
But only Benny went to the field. I went with him. At that time I gave the covenant medal into his hands. He went to the field reciting the Creed: “What is impossible for man is possible for God.”

32
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,999
He prayed in the fields like that, reciting and sitting there.

33
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:37,999
Then everyone asked Benny, “Why do you still go to the fields and just sit there? Isn’t it a wasted field that’s going to be thrown away?”

34
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:44,999
We would reply, it’s okay. Benny would say, “I believe in God. Nothing is impossible for God. We fully trust.”

35
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:54,999
Then when the field next to ours was harvested, their yield was short. For every 108 kilos given, only 100 kilos were accepted, the rest was deducted as wastage.

36
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:02,999
I told Mother, “Mother, please bless us so that our paddy may be accepted justly and fairly.” That was my prayer.

37
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:07,999
Within a week after seeing that sign, the rains stopped completely.

38
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,999
From that day onward, it did not rain again. We kept watching in faith.

39
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,999
After that came a blazing sun, such a strong sun that it felt like it was burning us.

40
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:23,999
The machine we had gone everywhere asking for but couldn’t get, first two came, on the 15th two more arrived.

41
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:29,999
Then came a terribly strong sun, and in three days the entire field dried completely.

42
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:37,999
We don’t know from where the machines came, but we too got four machines, and in three days the entire field was harvested.

43
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:43,999
Mother did it without losing even a single grain. Everyone else had abandoned it, saying let it go, let it be wasted.

44
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:49,999
In that very place, Mother blessed so that not a single stalk was lost and everything could be harvested.

45
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:56,999
Likewise, in that entire field only one kilo of paddy was lost as wastage, and that became a great wonder for everyone.

46
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,999
How did this happen? It was Mother’s great grace. Mother gave us everything without losing anything.

47
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:06,999
Because we had many debts, and we were educating two children, farming was our only income.

48
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:13,999
Earlier once, when we couldn’t harvest, I had come here and prayed, “Mother, give me the grace to bear it.”

49
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,999
Just like everyone else, there was tension, but I had no tension at all.

50
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:23,999
I had complete assurance and certainty that my Mother was with me.

51
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,999
Not a single stalk from the field was lost, everything was gathered, and Mother gave us all we needed, and we could repay much of our debt.

52
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:36,999
Only one kilo was lost in our entire field. Such a thing had never happened for anyone before.

53
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:42,999
In that one field, only one kilo of paddy was lost, not for one person but for the whole field, for everyone together.

54
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:47,999
Mother blessed us so mercifully and justly.

55
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:55,999
I give thanks to Mother who blessed like this. I am also someone going for cancer follow-up.

56
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:01,999
Recently, I had back pain and leg pain. When I went to church, I felt sad.

57
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,999
I don’t like sitting on chairs, so I would sit on the floor as much as I could.

58
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:11,999
But it became a condition where I couldn’t bear it at all. On October 8th, when I went for hospital follow-up, finally I told the doctor.

59
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:17,999
Until then, I had only applied Mother’s oil. I never used any extra medicine.

60
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:23,999
When I told this, the doctor said, “Now don’t worry about anything, just see ortho and do the exercises they tell.”

61
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:29,999
But in 2019, I had given a vow to Mother: “Mother, if you make me healthy and able to walk,

62
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:35,999
I will participate in your rally every single day without missing even once.” I had told this to Mother.

63
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:41,999
Then I thought, no, if I go to ortho and start doing the exercises, then my family will never allow me to go anywhere.

64
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:47,999
So I thought, no matter what, I said, wherever I go, I will never miss Mother’s rally.

65
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:53,999
So I came to Mother’s rally, walking barefoot through this shore, praying to Mother.

66
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:58,999
I prayed that I should not cause any trouble to anyone, because from our house, everyone comes together to join the rally.

67
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,999
I should not be the reason for anyone else to face difficulty.

68
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:11,999
So I prayed to Mother and walked, and without any problem I was able to take part fully in that rally up to the Artunkal church.

69
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,999
After that I never had leg pain or anything else again.

70
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,999
Now I am able to go to church every day without any problem at all.

71
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:25,999
Also, learning the Word was my desire. Always during my father’s covenant meditation, I used to feel that I should learn.

72
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:32,999
But I couldn’t do it. Even if I wrote inside books, after one or two weeks that book would be lost, and I would stop studying.

73
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:42,999
But I told my Mother, “Mother, I too want to learn the Word. Please grant me the grace to learn the Word, so that I too can recite the Word like others do.”

74
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:50,999
I always prayed like that to Mother. Then in our Changanassery diocese, three years ago, they started a ‘100 count Bible competition.’

75
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:58,999
I thought, this is surely a great grace that Mother gave me, so I participated. By God’s grace, all three years I could say to Mother,

76
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:03,999
“Mother, let me not forget anything except this Word. Help me to recite it without forgetting.”

77
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:08,999
So whenever I go to church, only this Word stays in my mind, I have no tension. Earlier, even for a small thing, I had terrible tension.

78
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,999
If the children went somewhere and I didn’t see them, I would feel terrible tension.

79
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:17,999
But now I have no tension at all. My God's Word—this is what I pray to Mother for. Then to Jesus Himself, only the Word.

80
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:21,999
Each Word I keep repeating in my mind. I don’t think about other things.

81
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:28,999
Like that, Mother gave me the grace to learn nearly a thousand verses. For all that, I thank Mother.

82
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:34,999
I confess once every two weeks. Every day I go to church.

83
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:40,999
Now, near anyone, whoever it may be, I have no tension at all. To anyone, when I speak about Mother, I feel a great pride.

84
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,999
Whether it is priests, not just priests, even sisters, or priests’ relatives—

85
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,999
when sisters or their people come near, I never feel any shyness.

86
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:54,999
To speak about my Mother to anyone gives me great pride and joy.

87
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:59,999
My children and our whole life itself are only because of Mother’s great grace and mercy.

88
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,999
Because to carry on all this, to educate both my children well, Mother is providing the grace and also the money needed.

89
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:07,999
People ask, “How do you manage all this?” I reply, “It is through Mother’s grace. Mother is providing. I trust in Mother.”

90
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:13,999
I tell everything to my Mother. To others, I never share my sorrows or troubles like that.

91
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:19,999
I tell my Mother, “Mother, if this is Your will, then please show me the way and means for it.”

92
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:24,999
I never tell anyone else. But the funny thing is, after saying this, I often forget about it.

93
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:28,999
But when it later happens, then only I remember—“Oh, I had told this to my Mother!”

94
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:34,999
That’s how it happens. I have full assurance and certainty that my Mother is with me.

95
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:39,999
Because here we have the live Adoration Chapel. I have very deep faith in it.

96
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:44,999
Whenever I have any need, or if my mind feels any tension, the first thing I do is take the live Adoration.

97
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:49,999
I get the answer for that immediately.

98
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,999
Always, I receive a sign from my Mother in a way that makes me feel She is right beside me.

99
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,999
I have such a firm faith and certainty that my Mother is always with me.

100
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:05,999
As works of mercy—if someone near me shares their sorrow, I will tell them about the covenant and lead them to take it.

101
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:11,999
I will send them to make the covenant. Now, even for my children’s friends in Thiruvananthapuram, I ask them, “Do you want to take the covenant?”

102
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:15,999
I tell them, “Go home,” and then bring them to their house. Even if someone from their house comes, it’s fine.

103
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:19,999
I will say, “You go,” and then bring them here, and help them take the covenant.

104
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:24,999
Even those near my house, in whatever way I can, I bring them, guide them, and let them take the covenant.

105
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,999
Whoever wants to take it, I help them to do so.

106
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,999
Also, newspapers—I try to buy and distribute them every month as much as I can.

107
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:40,999
Along with that, sometimes I buy blessed medals. Then when I know a house where there is sorrow, I give those medals to them.

108
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:47,999
I tell them, “Keep this medal and pray.” Then I say, “If you have even a little faith, you will receive a sign.”

109
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:52,999
If they are Hindus or anyone else, I send them the apparition prayer.

110
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:57,999
After sending, I tell them, “You pray this, and once your heart feels faith and assurance,

111
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,999
you should come to Mother, sit for a while in front of Her, and pray. Then Mother will hear your prayer.”

112
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:09,999
And every day I watch Daily Bread. I share it in all groups.

113
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,999
Every morning, before going to church, I listen to Daily Bread. Only after that do I go to church.

114
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:19,999
Also, as support—our main income is farming. From that,

115
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:25,999
from what we get, we give a share to the sick and also to Yesu Bhavan, wherever we can give.

116
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:32,999
We give in our own way. We give clothes. Then we also go visit the sick and help them with whatever they need.

117
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:39,999
For all these great blessings, I give a thousand thanks to Mother and to the Holy Son.

118
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:45,999
And I only pray that for the rest of my life, I may live as Mother’s child, with Her grace and blessing.

119
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,999
Thank You, Jesus. Praise You, Jesus.

120
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:52,999
2 Corinthians  9:10

121
00:11:53,000 --> 00:12:05,999
“He who supplies seed to the sower and bread for food will also supply and increase your store of seed and enlarge the harvest of your righteousness.”

122
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:09,999
Sister Rose Benny here,

123
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:18,999
testifies at the altar of Mother about how, in a great crisis faced by her family,

124
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:24,999
the covenant life with Mother of Grace worked wonders and helped them.

125
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:31,999
On nine acres of leased paddy fields, while they were farming, just days before the harvest,

126
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:40,999
there came heavy rains. In that rain, the entire field was so flooded that not a single grain of paddy could be seen.

127
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:48,999
Everyone said the harvest was fully destroyed.

128
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:56,999
But it was at that time that she entrusted not just her field but the entire farmland to Mother of Kreupasanam, praying for all.

129
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:04,999
She said that before sowing, every time, she would spread covenant salt all across the field.

130
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:12,999
Always sowing the seeds by reciting the apparition prayer and the declaration of faith.

131
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:20,999
Because it was by making Mother the owner that this farming family carried out all their work.

132
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:28,999
They dreamed so much, seeing the field standing with good crop, but then suddenly in one rain, all of it got submerged.

133
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:36,999
Everyone said, “Not a single grain is above the water, everything is gone.”

134
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:47,999
But even then, Sister says, “I did not worry or fear much. I would give a covenant medal into my husband’s hand and send him straight to the field to pray.

135
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,999
Often I too would go along.”

136
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:57,999
While no one else would go into that flooded area, both of us went together,

137
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:04,999
holding the covenant medal, reciting the declaration of Faith, praying the Rosary, and looking over that field.

138
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:12,999
We prayed with the desire that by the protection of Mother of Grace and the intervention of Jesus,

139
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:19,999
the floodwaters would recede and not even a single grain of paddy would be lost.

140
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:25,999
Along with that, we usually offer Holy Mass before the harvest. But that year, we had not done it.

141
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:33,999
So we went to the church, wrote down the Mass intention, and prayed at Mother’s side there.

142
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:42,999
After the prayer, when coming out, Sister saw a great rainbow in the sky.

143
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:51,999
When she saw the rainbow, she clearly understood that it was the sign of Mother’s presence and the beginning of Her mighty work.

144
00:14:52,000 --> 00:15:00,999
With great joy, she told everyone, “I saw Mother’s rainbow. Now we don’t need to doubt. Things will be set right.”

145
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:08,999
With much surrender and faith, the family prayed. Then came a burning hot sun.

146
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:15,999
But not a single grain was lost—every stalk of paddy stood firm.

147
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:24,999
In just a few days, Mother of Grace changed the weather completely in their favor so they could harvest everything.

148
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:31,999
Moreover, at the rice mills, the common practice was if you gave 108 kilos, they would weigh it as only 100 kilos.

149
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:38,999
Everyone knew this little injustice.

150
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:45,999
Sister entrusted even this into Mother’s hands, praying that She would intervene for justice.

151
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:53,999
And so the mill owners dropped the 108 rule and agreed to adjust it fairly as 101 kilos for 100.

152
00:15:54,000 --> 00:16:00,999
With that, the good harvest helped the family clear debts. What they thought was completely lost,

153
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:04,999
Mother of Grace miraculously saved, protecting their livelihood.

154
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:17,999
Another important intention Sister had offered was for her back pain,

155
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:25,999
which was so severe she couldn’t walk. But she had to attend the perpetual Rosary rally.

156
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:32,999
Everyone suggested she should see the doctor first and go for treatment, but Sister decided,

157
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:39,999
“Only after finishing the Rosary will I go to the hospital.” She anointed herself with covenant oil, made the sign of the cross, and prayed.

158
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,999
Fully entrusting her life to Mother, she came for the rally, participating from start to finish,

159
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:49,999
without any difficulty, under Mother’s protection, walking all the way to the Church of the Lord.

160
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:57,999
From that day, her back pain was completely healed. That is the second marked testimony.

161
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:09,999
The third is her great desire and thirst to study the Word of God. Sister says,

162
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:16,999
she tried many times—whenever Father preached a homily, she would write it down in notebooks.

163
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:22,999
But often the books would be misplaced or lost, so she couldn’t study properly.

164
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:29,999
Later she entrusted this petition also to Mother, asking that Mother of Grace herself would teach her the Word.

165
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:35,999
Soon after, in her diocese, a Bible study program called Noorumeni (Hundred Measures) was started, and she joined it.

166
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:38,999
Now, by Mother’s help, she has learned thousands of Scripture verses and can recite them well.

167
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:48,999
Not only that, in the Noorumeni Bible study competition held last year at Forane,

168
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:55,999
Mother of Grace helped Sister to win first place. Thus, everything she asked of Mother at each moment,

169
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:02,999
Mother stood with her, turning them into blessings in her life. It is testimony that by Her presence, helping in time,

170
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:09,999
and granting deliverance, even from heavy burdens where everything seemed lost, not a single thing was lost but abundance was given.

171
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:17,999
This is the testimony of the great closeness and richness that Sister shares at this altar. Others,

172
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:25,999
many times when seeing these situations, opposed, mocked, or spoke against her. But in those times,

173
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:35,999
I am fully convinced and assured that my Jesus and my Mother will intervene in my life and will help me.

174
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:43,999
Without minding any opposing words, Mother helped the family to move forward. This is the twelfth time that Sister

175
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,999
is renewing the covenant.

176
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:52,999
With steadfastness and faithfulness in the covenant, in every unexpected issue of the family,

177
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:59,999
God has worked as a blessing by standing with them—this she testifies at this altar. Let us

178
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:05,999
pray that the burdens of our lives may be lightened. Let us pray that our Mother of Shortening Time

179
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:13,999
may quickly grant solutions to the special problems that our families are passing through.

180
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:18,999
Let us pray that whatever we cannot achieve on our own, whatever we call impossible,

181
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:25,999
Jesus may grant it for us through the grace of Mother. With thanksgiving for the blessings

182
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:32,999
received in this family, let us clap our hands and offer a testimony of gratitude to Mother and the Holy Son.

183
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:44,999
Extraordinary divine experiences can now be yours too. If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe now.

184
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:49,000
Share this video right now with your friends, spreading the word of the Lord.
